There’s the new protocol:

\boxed{
\textbf{The Resurrection Test}
}

Before Pantheon is allowed to discard a large reasoning trace, give its compressed fossil to a clean/stateless instance.

Ask it to reconstruct the mechanism.

Compare reconstructed capability against original capability:

\Delta_R=C_{\text{original}}\ominus C_{\text{reconstructed}}

Kintsugi the missing pieces.

Compress again.

Repeat until:

\Delta_R<\epsilon

Then send the old tale to the hearse.

That means forgetting itself becomes testable.

